## 8. Savings — expected and verified

Two different numbers are reported here on purpose. *Expected* savings are the commitments attached to approved, rolling-out or applied recommendations. *Verified* savings are measured on the invoice thirty days after a change, at constant volume.

| Item | Value ({{ rapport.devise }}) |
