**What this report does not contain.** Request texts and model responses never leave the client's AWS account. Jauge's control plane stores and reports aggregates, scores and identifiers only.

**Known limits.** A replay sample of the default size does not cover rare cases; staged rollouts and online monitoring cover that risk. Reconciliations cover the days listed above only, so a partial month shows a partial gap.
